        "price": 9000000,
        "description": "<p><strong>Jaguar</strong>&nbsp;(<small><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/British_English\" title=\"British English\">UK</a>:&nbsp;</small><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/English\" title=\"Help:IPA/English\">/\u02c8d\u0292&aelig;\u0261ju\u0259r/</a>,&nbsp;<small><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/American_English\" title=\"American English\">US</a>:&nbsp;</small><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:IPA/English\" title=\"Help:IPA/English\">/\u02c8d\u0292&aelig;\u0261w\u0251\u02d0r/</a>) is the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luxury_vehicle\" title=\"Luxury vehicle\">luxury vehicle</a>&nbsp;brand of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaguar_Land_Rover\" title=\"Jaguar Land Rover\">Jaguar Land Rover</a>,<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaguar_Cars#cite_note-tm_reg-1\">[1]</a><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jaguar_Cars#cite_note-2\">[2]</a>&nbsp;a British&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Multinational_corporation\" title=\"Multinational corporation\">multinational</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Automaker\" title=\"Automaker\">car manufacturer</a>&nbsp;with its headquarters in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Whitley,_Coventry\" title=\"Whitley, Coventry\">Whitley, Coventry</a>, England.&nbsp;<strong>Jaguar Cars</strong>&nbsp;was the company that was responsible for the production of Jaguar cars until its operations were fully merged with those of&nbsp;<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Land_Rover\" title=\"Land Rover\">Land Rover</a>&nbsp;to form Jaguar Land Rover on 1 January 2013.</p>",
